                                "sense_id": "537b1822-29af-34ae-a790-8adc18b44642",
                                "text": "This particular type of marijuana is a favorite of the rapper as well as many other weed aficionados. Known for its sweet smell, Kush also packs quite the punch with a high level of tetrahydrocannabinol (THC)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9e46113-46ad-40ad-a1ba-4a54961a3e22",
                                "sense_id": "537b1822-29af-34ae-a790-8adc18b44642",
                                "text": "Kush is a pure indica and is a short, compact plant. A two-time winner of the international Cannabis Cup, Kush is very popular among indica growers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
